# Build context for the hardened tool images is docker/ (the default
# dxdfir_images_context) so the shared build-time hardening playbook under
# hardening/ is in reach. The content below is NOT part of that shared context —
# excluding it keeps the context small and stops unrelated changes from
# invalidating every tool image's build cache.

# The GoDFIR-toolz submodule: images that need it build from it DIRECTLY
# (dxdfir_images_eztools_context = docker/GoDFIR-toolz, its own context), never
# from the shared docker/ context.
GoDFIR-toolz/

# The SOF-ELK compose stack is a deployment, not a tool-image build input. (The
# Elastic stack moved out to the repo-root stacks/; SOF-ELK is being retired.)
sof-elk/
